  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your luck is such that catastrophe occurs less frequently for you when you are engaged in stressful situations.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenge\">Skill Challenge</a> that has a chance of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Catastrophic_Failure\" title=\"Catastrophic Failure\">Catastrophic Failure</a>, this Failure occurs only if you fail a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> by 15 or more. In addition, when a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Catastrophic_Failure\" title=\"Catastrophic Failure\">Catastrophic Failure</a> occurs, you accrue one Failure in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenge\">Skill Challenge</a>, not two.</p><p><b>Special:</b> This Feat is allowed only in campaigns that use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenges\">Skill Challenges</a>.</p>",
